===Adjective===
{{en-adj|er}}

# Resembling [[milk]] in [[color]] or [[consistency]].
#* Alexander Pope
#*: pails high foaming with a '''milky''' flood
#* Arbuthnot
#*: '''milky''' juice
# {{lb|en|color science|informal}} Of the [[black]] in an [[image]], appearing as dark [[gray]] rather than black.
# {{lb|en|colloquial}} [[cowardly|Cowardly]].
#* Shakespeare
#*: Has friendship such a faint and '''milky''' heart?
# {{lb|en|obsolete}} Yielding milk.
#* Roscommon
#*: '''milky''' mothers

